The plate looks like a paper plate about 22 cm across, so I'm treating it as a side plate of roughly 20 cm. On it are about 12 sausage slices, probably smoked sausage or andouille. Each slice is about 4 cm across and 1.5-2 cm thick, so about 12-15 g each, which gives roughly 150-180 g in total.

Smoked sausage runs about 250-300 kcal per 100 g. At roughly 160 g, that comes to about 430 kcal. The slices could be lighter, so I'm settling on about 150 g and 400 kcal.

